    "sub_name": "投資與程式交易",
    "sub_ename": "INVESTMENT AND PROGRAM TRADING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹程式交易的基本概念，透過虛擬交易所和下單API的串接，學習建立交易策略且執行程式下單，並進行適當的風險管控。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces basic concepts of program trading, and learns to build trading strategies and use program trading. We will use the virtual trading system and orders API to test our strategies and manage the risks accordingly.",
